{"id":"n17189-1-0","stage":0,"title":"아니요 · 不是","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17189-1-0-1","ko":"승규야, 숙제는 다 했니?","zh":"承奎，作业做完了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}},{"text":"숙제는","meaning":"作业","explanation":"숙제：作业；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"숙제","audio":"/audio/b33db886cc66d3923b91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65226","senseId":"1","lemma":"숙제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숙제는","audio":"/audio/550c6fb04be1c9460a70.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"했니?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했니","audio":"/audio/1889ab3866856ff3fbae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b33db886cc66d392","term":"숙제","zh":"作业","audio":"/audio/b33db886cc66d3923b91.mp3","entryId":"65226","definition":"为了复习或预习，给学生布置的课后功课。","pronunciation":["숙쩨"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"一点不剩或不落下而全部。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cc7fdb2b9904146ea8cc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17189-1-0-2","ko":"아니요, 노느라 아직 다 못했어요.","zh":"还没呢，一直在玩，所以还没